# Vauxhall Astra Mk5 (Astra H) five-door hatchback, 2004-2009.
#
# 4,249 mm long, 1,753 mm wide, 1,460 mm high, 2,614 mm wheelbase; 1.4-2.0
# petrol and diesels. The Opel Astra H is the same car.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Astra#Astra_H_(2004%E2%80%932009)
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Star Silver, Flame Red and Metro Blue are period
# Vauxhall colours.
#
# Weight: 280 in total (silver 90, black 75, red 60, blue 55).
#
# Speed 190 km/h; comfort 115/350 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 2004-2009 with a road tail to about 2018.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-astra-mk5.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-astra-mk5/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

